DEDICATION TO HUMANITY & PATENT NOTICE

This work, including the Grounded Axiomatic Tower, the core axioms, conceptual
frameworks, mathematical structures, and related ideas ("the Core Ideas"), is
released for the benefit of humanity.

**Core Ideas Protection**

The foundational concepts, axioms, and theoretical frameworks presented in this
repository are intended to remain open and freely available to all of humanity.
No person, organization, or entity should file or enforce patents that attempt
to monopolize, restrict, or claim exclusive rights over these Core Ideas.

**Derivative Implementations**

Nothing in this notice prevents individuals or organizations from developing
specific technical implementations, devices, methods, products, or applications
based on these ideas. Such parties may seek patent protection for their own
specific implementations, provided they do not attempt to patent the underlying
Core Ideas themselves.

This document serves as a public record of the author's intent: to keep the
foundational knowledge open while allowing practical and commercial development
on top of it.

The author claims no financial gain, royalties, or exclusive rights from any 
patents filed on specific implementations derived from this work. This document 
